# Transition and Migration

> Conditional entry point. Generation does not establish that a migration is
> needed, authorized, compatible, or complete.

## Applicability assessment

- Status: `not_assessed`
- Triggers: established-project adoption, replacement, split or merge, or
  major dossier, harness, architecture, or implementation upgrade
- Assessed on: not assessed
- Assessor and basis: not assessed

Record the durable assessment on conceptual type `TRN-0001` in the artifact
registry. `applicable` or `not_applicable` requires `assessed_on`,
`assessed_by`, and a rationale; retain a not-applicable type record after
removing its physical representation.

Use this package when adopting the Octon harness into an established project or
replacing a prior dossier, harness, architecture, process, or implementation.

Required transition views:

- authority and decision delta;
- file and concept crosswalk;
- compatibility classification;
- migration sequence;
- stop, continue, and pause rules;
- rollback;
- adoption checklist;
- verified supersession.

